<title>GERMANY: Hoechst expects 96 pre-tax profit of 6 billion dmk.</title>
<headline>Hoechst expects 96 pre-tax profit of 6 billion dmk.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals group Hoechst AG said on Wednesday that it expects to post a group pre-tax profit of around six billion marks ($3.9 billion) in full-year 1996.</p>
<p>The group also expects to post sales of around 51 billion marks and operating profit of nearly five billion marks, management board chairman Juergen Dormann said in a speech at the group's nine-month news conference.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525 ($ = 1.522 German Marks)</p>
